  "author": "0x_Akoko",
  "severity": "MEDIUM",
  "description": "WordPress Eatery theme 2.2 contains an open redirect vulnerability. The theme accepts a user-controlled input that specifies a link to an external site. An attacker can redirect a user to a malicious site and possibly obtain sensitive information, modify data, and/or execute unauthorized operations.\n",
